{"1803110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ASCENDANT", "steam_appid": 1803110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Join us on Discord</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/77d744cbb131c26cdec669dfe9e47b36.avif?t=1773170319\" width=780 height=147 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to ASCENDANT, where you, your squad of unlikely heroes, and four biocores are all that stand between survival and total annihilation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/231723cbeea329e0db0b7816fc706404.avif?t=1773170319\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/9991498f02954fcb06a35bcc14677dff.poster.avif?t=1773170319\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/9991498f02954fcb06a35bcc14677dff.webm?t=1773170319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/9991498f02954fcb06a35bcc14677dff.mp4?t=1773170319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASCENDANT is capture-the-flag... on crack. After a thousand-year cryo-nap, you wake up to find the world’s gone to sh*t: mutant wildlife, rogue tech, and rival squads battling for biocores filled with amber that keep your Shade alive. The catch? Every match is different. Thanks to the virtual Game Director, biocore locations, available rooms, and wild events shift with every game, forcing you to adapt... or die. Four teams, four biocores… you do the math.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/c0167e188a7657c5da00d4a2e93b9d62.avif?t=1773170319\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/43755526f0e939909ff5fd0eb6d38450.poster.avif?t=1773170319\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/43755526f0e939909ff5fd0eb6d38450.webm?t=1773170319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/43755526f0e939909ff5fd0eb6d38450.mp4?t=1773170319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters. Spend power wisely - your team’s collective pool grows as you fight mutant creatures, and how you use it can mean the difference between victory and a humiliating respawn. Unlock weapons and items mid-match to outsmart your enemies. Whether you’re upgrading your gear, setting traps, or going full kamikaze, victory comes down to one thing: adapting fast - because the map’s out to ruin your best-laid plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/3821b925fd1b618227d0a9a619836902.avif?t=1773170319\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/ef2e5453d20730e2fb5d5b6279a0407d.poster.avif?t=1773170319\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/ef2e5453d20730e2fb5d5b6279a0407d.webm?t=1773170319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/ef2e5453d20730e2fb5d5b6279a0407d.mp4?t=1773170319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two matches are ever the same. Dynamic events, from sudden airstrikes to mutated mega-beasts, can flip the game on its head, ruining even the most carefully planned strategy. Lethal creatures and environmental hazards keep the stakes high and the chaos higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/53cd98285c99b6d518af10f5ef7954f9.avif?t=1773170319\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/d83bac3074d6937079d1c01a4892f278.poster.avif?t=1773170319\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/d83bac3074d6937079d1c01a4892f278.webm?t=1773170319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/d83bac3074d6937079d1c01a4892f278.mp4?t=1773170319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the gun the government warned you about. From grenade-launching sniper rifles to poison-spitting SMGs, ASCENDANT’s weapon customization offers 3 million mod combinations, letting you craft the ultimate overkill machine. But no matter how good your Franken-gun is, someone’s probably built something bigger, badder, and aimed it right at your head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/eee6d8e8cfebeb358acf3764db4da006.avif?t=1773170319\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/5f227a179df4e2c8c2d503beec73e6f9.poster.avif?t=1773170319\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/5f227a179df4e2c8c2d503beec73e6f9.webm?t=1773170319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/5f227a179df4e2c8c2d503beec73e6f9.mp4?t=1773170319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fine-tune your character’s abilities and perks to suit your playstyle, whether you’re the ultimate biocore thief or the squad’s chaotic wildcard. Between matches, head to the social lobby, duel frenemies, or gear up for more mayhem. Or, if you’re craving an extra dose of carnage, enter the Thunderdome - a PvP arena where the only goal is to leave in one piece (and with bragging rights). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s brutal. It’s BioPunk. It’s survival with zero hand-holding... but it does have an epic soundtrack ('Final Countdown' anyone?). ASCENDANT keeps the action unpredictable and the stakes as high as your blood pressure. Bring your wits, your best squad, and maybe a will. You’re going to need all three.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to ASCENDANT, where you, your squad of unlikely heroes, and four biocores are all that stand between survival and total annihilation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/231723cbeea329e0db0b7816fc706404.avif?t=1773170319\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/9991498f02954fcb06a35bcc14677dff.poster.avif?t=1773170319\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/9991498f02954fcb06a35bcc14677dff.webm?t=1773170319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/9991498f02954fcb06a35bcc14677dff.mp4?t=1773170319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASCENDANT is capture-the-flag... on crack. After a thousand-year cryo-nap, you wake up to find the world’s gone to sh*t: mutant wildlife, rogue tech, and rival squads battling for biocores filled with amber that keep your Shade alive. The catch? Every match is different. Thanks to the virtual Game Director, biocore locations, available rooms, and wild events shift with every game, forcing you to adapt... or die. Four teams, four biocores… you do the math.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/c0167e188a7657c5da00d4a2e93b9d62.avif?t=1773170319\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/43755526f0e939909ff5fd0eb6d38450.poster.avif?t=1773170319\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/43755526f0e939909ff5fd0eb6d38450.webm?t=1773170319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/43755526f0e939909ff5fd0eb6d38450.mp4?t=1773170319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision matters. Spend power wisely - your team’s collective pool grows as you fight mutant creatures, and how you use it can mean the difference between victory and a humiliating respawn. Unlock weapons and items mid-match to outsmart your enemies. Whether you’re upgrading your gear, setting traps, or going full kamikaze, victory comes down to one thing: adapting fast - because the map’s out to ruin your best-laid plans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/3821b925fd1b618227d0a9a619836902.avif?t=1773170319\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/ef2e5453d20730e2fb5d5b6279a0407d.poster.avif?t=1773170319\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/ef2e5453d20730e2fb5d5b6279a0407d.webm?t=1773170319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/ef2e5453d20730e2fb5d5b6279a0407d.mp4?t=1773170319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two matches are ever the same. Dynamic events, from sudden airstrikes to mutated mega-beasts, can flip the game on its head, ruining even the most carefully planned strategy. Lethal creatures and environmental hazards keep the stakes high and the chaos higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/53cd98285c99b6d518af10f5ef7954f9.avif?t=1773170319\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/d83bac3074d6937079d1c01a4892f278.poster.avif?t=1773170319\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/d83bac3074d6937079d1c01a4892f278.webm?t=1773170319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/d83bac3074d6937079d1c01a4892f278.mp4?t=1773170319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the gun the government warned you about. From grenade-launching sniper rifles to poison-spitting SMGs, ASCENDANT’s weapon customization offers 3 million mod combinations, letting you craft the ultimate overkill machine. But no matter how good your Franken-gun is, someone’s probably built something bigger, badder, and aimed it right at your head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/eee6d8e8cfebeb358acf3764db4da006.avif?t=1773170319\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/5f227a179df4e2c8c2d503beec73e6f9.poster.avif?t=1773170319\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/5f227a179df4e2c8c2d503beec73e6f9.webm?t=1773170319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/extras/5f227a179df4e2c8c2d503beec73e6f9.mp4?t=1773170319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fine-tune your character’s abilities and perks to suit your playstyle, whether you’re the ultimate biocore thief or the squad’s chaotic wildcard. Between matches, head to the social lobby, duel frenemies, or gear up for more mayhem. Or, if you’re craving an extra dose of carnage, enter the Thunderdome - a PvP arena where the only goal is to leave in one piece (and with bragging rights). </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s brutal. It’s BioPunk. It’s survival with zero hand-holding... but it does have an epic soundtrack ('Final Countdown' anyone?). ASCENDANT keeps the action unpredictable and the stakes as high as your blood pressure. Bring your wits, your best squad, and maybe a will. You’re going to need all three.</p>", "short_description": "High stakes, high chaos, and the most unpredictable twist on capture-the-flag yet. Outwit ruthless opponents, face mutant wildlife, and secure four biocores in this fast-paced FPS where wild events can turn the tables in an ever-shifting BioPunk arena. This is ASCENDANT - bring backup.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“…the adrenaline rush of trying to fight off other teams for that last biocore is nothing short of thrilling.”<br>Inverse<br><br>“I haven’t enjoyed a shooter this much in quite some time.”<br>The Outerhaven<br><br>“Like life, nothing in this world stays the same. The map, the tactics, the teams, the strategies, the events, they're all different every time you step out.”<br>Bleeding Cool<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/ab2cc8f6fd1b3c3754c44dd9876dad54c246bca9/header.jpg?t=1773170319", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/81a73918e67361e1cb6162a2d05afe723bcfcb1f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773170319", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1803110/81a73918e67361e1cb6162a2d05afe723bcfcb1f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773170319", "website": "https://www.ascendant.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit (Version 1909 revision .1350 or higher) / Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 10600 or Ryzen 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1070 or RX 580 with 6GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit (Version 1909 revision .1350 or higher) / Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-10700K or Ryzen 7 3700X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX 2070 Super or RX 5700XT with 8GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "Copyright © 2025 - PlayFusion Ltd has bases in the United Kingdom and the United States of America.", "developers": ["PlayFusion"], "publishers": ["PlayFusion"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux